{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16223150","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16223150","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1622315001:0":{"text":"The sun came up too early today. That's on you!","source_cn":"这天亮得那么早，是你搞的鬼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643D3508C9598FCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622315002:0":{"text":"And all that shiny stuff? How're we supposed to sleep with that blasting in our faces?","source_cn":"弄些亮闪闪，俺们还睡不睡了​？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BC2D5F6CBCF7EDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622315003:1":{"text":"We just want to sleep!","source_cn":"​要睡觉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58A6E07604D155AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622315004:1":{"text":"You try to reason with them—it's almost summer, the days get longer, the nights get shorter, and none of it has anything to do with you.","source_cn":"你尝试向它们解释：夏季临近，白昼逐日延长，黑夜相应缩短...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB1E5300E5DA603","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You try to reason with them—it's almost summer, the days get longer, the nights get shorter, and none of it has anything to do with you.","female":"You try to reason with them—it's almost summer, the days get longer, the nights get shorter, and none of it has anything to do with you.","variant_male_record_index":"209773","variant_female_record_index":"209774","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1622315005:1":{"text":"Don't care. All I know is I'm sleepy!","source_cn":"​俺不听！什么天长地短，俺就知道困！​","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31EBC07FE25A556E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622315006:1":{"text":"So sleepy I'm about to spin in the air! Look!","source_cn":"困！飞起来打转转！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEF471DF4F171E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622315007:1":{"text":"So shut the shiny stuff off already!","source_cn":"赶紧把亮闪闪撤喽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9625E2B8F6249EF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622315008:1":{"text":"Or I'll holler loud enough to bring my uncle, my cousin, and whoever else hears me!","source_cn":"不然俺就嗷嗷叫，把俺二姨父、三表哥全喊来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41CC884EA449D717","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1622315009:1":{"text":"Big family meeting! Right here!","source_cn":"开大会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BC69FBDCDB01655","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_mal